SUMMARY:The Irish Tenors
LOCATION:HOPE Center for the Arts\, 150 Bridge St\, Springfield\, MA 01103
DESCRIPTION:For more than a quarter century\, The Irish Tenors have thrille
 d audiences around the world with their unmistakable blend of soaring clas
 sical voices\, Irish charm\, and heartfelt storytelling. Since first joini
 ng voices in 1998\, they have sold out iconic venues including Radio City 
 Music Hall\, Carnegie Hall\, the Sydney Opera House\, and The Hollywood Bo
 wl\, while becoming beloved PBS favorites through acclaimed specials such 
 as Ellis Island. With millions of albums sold and a repertoire that effort
 lessly spans treasured Irish ballads\, popular standards\, and stirring co
 ntemporary favorites\, The Irish Tenors have become one of the most succes
 sful Irish touring acts in the world.\nhttps://hopecenterforthearts.org/ev
 ents/irish-tenors-christmas/\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.c
 ity/westernma/
URL:https://hopecenterforthearts.org/events/irish-tenors-christmas/
END:VEVENT
