SUMMARY:Rickie Lee Jones
LOCATION:Bombyx\, 130 Pine St\, Florence\, MA 01062
DESCRIPTION:++ Pre-sale: Thursday\, August 13 @ 10am ET ++ ++ On-sale: Frid
 ay\, August 14 @ 10am ET ++ Rickie Lee Jones is an American musician\, sto
 ryteller\, two-time Grammy winner and eight-time nominee who has been insp
 iring pop culture for decades\, beginning with her star-making self-titled
  debut and the seminal Pirates. Named the “premiere song-stylist and son
 gwriter of her generation” by The New Yorker and “The Duchess of Cools
 ville” by Time magazine\, Jones released her Grammy-nominated album Piec
 es of Treasure in 2023\, a reunion with Russ Titelman\, who produced her f
 irst two records. Jones’ celebrated memoir Last Chance Texaco was named 
 Book of the Year by MOJO and on Best of Year lists by NPR\, Pitchfork\, an
 d many more. The Independent writes\, “There has always been something d
 efiant about Rickie Lee Jones... a voice from a dream\, elusive yet famili
 ar\, transcendent\, a messenger from another place.”\nhttps://bombyx.liv
 e/events/rickie-lee-jones-2/\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.c
 ity/westernma/
URL:https://bombyx.live/events/rickie-lee-jones-2/
END:VEVENT
