 k\, funk\, and bluegrass to create a unique sound all their own. Featuring
  Ethan Robbins on guitar/mandolin and Ariel Bernstein on drums/banjo\, thi
 s power duo from Boston is impressing audiences throughout New England and
  beyond. Punctuated by tight harmonies and skillful musicianship\, and wit
 h a focus on songwriting\, Cold Chocolate has quickly gained recognition f
 or their original music and high-energy shows. The band has shared bills w
 ith Leftover Salmon\, David Grisman\, Angelique Kidjo\, and regularly perf
 orms at venues and music festivals across the country.\nhttps://theparlorr
