SUMMARY:Ghost Ensemble: Evergreens
LOCATION:Bombyx\, 130 Pine St\, Florence\, MA 01062
DESCRIPTION:Ghost Ensemble creates experimental music that expands our perc
 eptual horizons through shared immersive experience. Dissolving boundaries
  of genre\, style\, and scene\, the ensemble collaborates widely with crea
 tors of contemporary chamber music\, avant-garde jazz\, and sound art\, am
 plifying highly original musical voices to explore the most innovative and
  exciting music of our time. Since its 2012 inception\, the ensemble has c
 ollaborated with a diverse range of composers who share a belief in music
 ’s potential for individual and community transformation\, including Sar
 ah Davachi\, Catherine Lamb\, Miya Masaoka\, Phill Niblock\, Pauline Olive
 ros\, and Yasunao Tone.\nhttps://bombyx.live/events/ghost-ensemble-evergre
 ens/\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
